  "details": "Do you want to get a good shot of you dancing in a MMD world or want a capture something cool that can happen in a split second, sounds like we need a Burst Mode on the VRChat Camera. Some people will say just \"git gud\" first I am good this NEW Mode for the Camera can make it easier for people that want that right shot. \n\nHow will it work you may ask? \n\nSample Open up camera then open the Camera Mode on the Camera and there you go it will be right there. \n\nHow many bursts will it take? \n\nIt will take 10 or 15 shots. \n\nThe reason the players of VRChat need this is we the players need more options that will make it easier for use the players to take pictures in VRChat. \n\n(the reason I want this is when I was doing a photoshoot with bf it takes us 3-4 hours of them drifting around the guard rill)",
